      "notes": "<p>Roll Options Dialog: on Technology tests, tick the Deconstructionist switch. Automatic: on a success against a vehicle or Zord, all its Skill Tests take a Snag until the end of its next turn (out of combat, the scene); against a creature, you pick the piece of its equipment you disrupted and only its tests using that item take the Snag. Shown as Deconstructionist next to Snag in its Roll Options Dialog. Left to the table: the Standard action, setting up the contest or DIF, the equipment being Computerized, and skipping distraction ↓ when you disrupt equipment.</p>"
